{
  "name": "vane-comment",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "插件式通用评论区引擎：点赞 / 排序 / 楼中楼 / 富编辑，视频·社交·电商评论区同一内核按需装配",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./dist/index.js",
  "module": "./dist/index.js",
  "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/index.js"
    },
    "./entries/core": {
      "types": "./dist/entries/core.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/entries/core.js"
    },
    "./entries/plugins": {
      "types": "./dist/entries/plugins.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/entries/plugins.js"
    },
    "./custom-plugins/LikePlugin": {
      "types": "./dist/custom-plugins/LikePlugin/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/custom-plugins/LikePlugin/index.js"
    },
    "./custom-plugins/RichComposerPlugin": {
      "types": "./dist/custom-plugins/RichComposerPlugin/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/custom-plugins/RichComposerPlugin/index.js"
    },
    "./custom-plugins/SortPlugin": {
      "types": "./dist/custom-plugins/SortPlugin/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/custom-plugins/SortPlugin/index.js"
    },
    "./custom-plugins/ThreadPlugin": {
      "types": "./dist/custom-plugins/ThreadPlugin/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/custom-plugins/ThreadPlugin/index.js"
    },
    "./custom-plugins": {
      "types": "./dist/custom-plugins/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/custom-plugins/index.js"
    },
    "./presets/ecommerce": {
      "types": "./dist/presets/ecommerce/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/presets/ecommerce/index.js"
    },
    "./presets/social": {
      "types": "./dist/presets/social/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/presets/social/index.js"
    },
    "./presets/video": {
      "types": "./dist/presets/video/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/presets/video/index.js"
    },
    "./custom-plugins/*": {
      "types": "./dist/custom-plugins/*/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/custom-plugins/*/index.js"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "dist"
  ],
  "sideEffects": false,
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "react",
    "plugin",
    "comment",
    "评论",
    "typescript"
  ],
  "author": "Frank Vane",
  "license": "MIT",
  "vane": {
    "sizeBudgetKb": 4,
    "subpathBudgets": {
      "./custom-plugins/LikePlugin": 2,
      "./custom-plugins/SortPlugin": 2,
      "./custom-plugins/ThreadPlugin": 4.5,
      "./custom-plugins/RichComposerPlugin": 4.5
    },
    "sizeBudgetNote": "根入口 = CommentCore（数据驱动列表壳）+ withCommentPlugins 装配器 + 领域槽 + 类型；vane-plugin-core 按 B1-A 走 peer 外部化（构建期外置，不进 dist），根 gzip 实测 3.7KB，预算 4KB 留余量（ADR-6 守住了：插件绝不进根入口）。四个官方插件严格走子路径 vane-comment/custom-plugins/*（ADR-6）。子路径闭包量的是「入口 + 共享内核(slots+content ~1.35KB) + 自身代码」——LikePlugin/SortPlugin 只是薄壳（1.5/1.9KB），但 ThreadPlugin（4.1KB）与 RichComposerPlugin（3.9KB）各自背着真实 UI：前者是递归楼中楼 + 内联回复框，后者是 emoji 选择器 + 图片 + @提及 + 实时预览的富编辑框，自身代码约 2.6/2.5KB。初版拍的 2KB 扁平预算对这两个重插件不成立（要压到 2KB 只能砍功能），故按「改口径必须写理由」的硬约束把二者调到 4.5KB，而非静默调大。三平台预设走 ./presets/* 整装逃生口，不单列预算（根入口不受影响）。"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/frankvane/vane-components.git",
    "directory": "packages/vane-comment"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "vite --config demo/vite.config.ts",
    "build": "vite build --mode lib",
    "build:demo": "vite build --config demo/vite.config.ts",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "docs:plugins": "node scripts/generate-plugin-docs.mjs",
    "sync:exports": "node ../../scripts/sync-exports.mjs",
    "prepublishOnly": "npm run build"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "react": ">=16.8.0",
    "react-dom": ">=16.8.0",
    "vane-plugin-core": "workspace:*"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^22.10.0",
    "@types/react": "^18.3.3",
    "@types/react-dom": "^18.3.0",
    "@vane/build-config": "workspace:*",
    "@vane/eslint-config": "workspace:*",
    "@vane/tsconfig": "workspace:*",
    "@vane/vitest-config": "workspace:*",
    "@vitejs/plugin-react": "^4.3.1",
    "happy-dom": "^15.11.7",
    "react": "^18.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^18.3.1",
    "react-router-dom": "^6.26.2",
    "typescript": "^5.6.3",
    "vane-plugin-core": "workspace:*",
    "vite": "^5.4.1",
    "vite-plugin-dts": "^4.5.4",
    "vitest": "^2.1.8"
  }
}
